<title>USA: RESEARCH ALERT - Chesapeake Energy.</title>
<headline>RESEARCH ALERT - Chesapeake Energy.</headline>
<text>
<p>-- Lehman Brothers analyst James Whipkey said he raised his rating on Chesapeake Energy Corp to buy from outperform.</p>
<p>-- &quot;Chesapeake Energy, one of the best performing stocks in the exploration and production sector, is poised for further growth,&quot; Whipkey said in a research note.</p>
<p>&quot;We believe the application of deep, largely horizontal, drilling technology will generate annual, domestic production volume growth in excess of 50 percent.&quot;</p>
<p>-- He said that shares were off almost 30 percent from their highs two weeks ago, driven down by technical factors and sector profit-taking.</p>
<p>-- Shares were up 1-1/2 at 52-7/8.</p>
</text>
